# Kairo v3.0.0 — Environment Variables
#
# Kairo is a BYOK (Bring Your Own Key) app.
# All API keys are entered by the user in Settings and stored in their browser's
# localStorage — they are NEVER stored on the server.
#
# No server-side environment variables are required to run Kairo.
# This file is intentionally minimal.

# Optional: set your deployment URL for proper OG metadata resolution
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://kairo.yashgarg.co.in
